  "historyNote": "#8339, eff 4-26-05; ss by #10190, eff 9-27-12 (from Saf-C 1901.15); ss by #10190, eff 9-27-1, EXPIRED: 9-27-22 New. #13614, eff 4-25-23 (formerly Saf-C 1901.13)",
